WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.286
Day 2. Two sounds at the end of a word.

2
00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:09.548
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.048 --> 00:00:14.562
Start with a word your child can read. Then one more sound is added at the end.

4
00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.008
The word is ten.

5
00:00:23.624 --> 00:00:24.692
The word is tent.

6
00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:30.383
Nothing is new about the sounds. What is new is saying them one right after the other.

7
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:36.875
There are cards to cut out on the next page. Each one shows two letters side by side, and a picture.

8
00:00:37.325 --> 00:00:41.881
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

9
00:00:42.331 --> 00:00:46.978
Do the four pairs of job one together. The short word first, then the new word.

10
00:00:47.428 --> 00:00:51.460
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

11
00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.798
Two letters, two sounds. Say each one. Then wait.

12
00:00:55.598 --> 00:01:01.171
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

13
00:01:01.621 --> 00:01:05.083
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
